</div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7625cf5e-824a-409c-844c-dc15103c89a9_941/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7625cf5e-824a-409c-844c-dc15103c89a9_941/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1740460242971_17296" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1740460242971_17296"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">
  
  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The time of year for this landing is critical because after March, disturbance of Wallops Island is strictly prohibited due to the nesting season for the loggerhead sea turtle, an endangered species protected by federal and state laws, as the state National Heritage Agency noted in subsequent reviews:</p></div>


  
