<div id="bscm-overlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="bscm-title">
  <div id="bscm-modal">

    <div id="bscm-header">
      <h2 id="bscm-title">Terms of Use</h2>
    </div>

    <div id="bscm-body">

      <p>The reports on this website are the property of Bleecker Street Research LLC (&ldquo;BSR&rdquo;). Your use of BSR&rsquo;s reports and this website is subject to and governed by the below Terms of Use (the &ldquo;Terms&rdquo;). The Terms govern all reports published by BSR (each a &ldquo;BSR Report&rdquo;) and supersede any prior Terms of Use governing the access and use of this website and BSR Reports, which you may download from this website. By downloading, accessing, or viewing any materials on this website, you hereby agree to the following Terms. In addition, before downloading or accessing any BSR Report, you will be required to affirmatively acknowledge that you have read and agree to these Terms by checking the box presented to you. Each BSR Report may also contain its own position, conflict, and compensation disclosures and an analyst certification, which supplement, and are incorporated into, these Terms.</p>

      <h3>Bleecker Street and Its Related Parties</h3>
      <p>BSR is under common control and affiliated with Bleecker Street Capital LLC (&ldquo;BSC&rdquo;), Bleecker Street Capital Management LLC (&ldquo;BSCM&rdquo;), and affiliated funds, including but not limited to Bleecker Street Minerva LP (&ldquo;Minerva&rdquo;) and Bleecker Street Partners LP (&ldquo;BSP&rdquo;). BSR, BSC, BSCM, Minerva, BSP, and their respective affiliates and related parties&mdash;including, without limitation, any principals, officers, directors, employees, members, clients, investors, consultants, and agents&mdash;are referred to collectively as &ldquo;Bleecker Street,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;we.&rdquo;</p>

      <h3>Bleecker Street&rsquo;s Business Model</h3>
      <p>BSR is a for-profit journalistic organization. BSR researches issues of concern to the general public, including issuers of publicly traded securities, and publishes due-diligence-based reports and its opinion journalism regarding these investigations online. BSR finances this journalism through a non-traditional revenue model where it earns revenue from positions that Bleecker Street, including BSC and BSCM, takes in the securities of issuers on which BSR reports.</p>
      <p>BSC and BSCM are investment advisers registered with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, and manage capital on behalf of outside investors, to whom they owe fiduciary duties. BSR&rsquo;s business model requires Bleecker Street to take material financial risk, which our partners have exposure to. To manage risk, we must close open positions as we deem prudent. We do not provide &ldquo;price targets&rdquo; for securities, although we may express our subjective opinion of the value of a security, which differs from a price target in that we neither know nor claim to know how the market might value such security. We therefore typically do not hold, and provide no assurance that we will hold, a position in a reported-on security until it reaches a price target, nor do we necessarily hold, or provide any assurance that we will hold, positions in securities until such securities reach the price that reflects our opinion of value.</p>
      <p>Many factors enter into investment decisions aside from opinions of the value of the security. Such factors often include, without limitation, borrow cost, &ldquo;short squeeze&rdquo; potential, risk sizing relative to capital and volatility, reduced information asymmetry, the opportunity cost of capital, client expectations, the ability to hedge market risk, our perception of the efficacy of market regulators and gatekeepers, our perception of the resource imbalance between us and any Covered Issuer (defined below), and our subjective perceptions. Therefore, you should assume that upon publication of a report, we will, or have begun to, close a substantial portion &ndash; possibly the entirety &ndash; of our positions in the Covered Issuer&rsquo;s securities.</p>

      <h3>Reports Are Solely Attributable to BSR</h3>
      <p>The BSR Reports on this website are opinion journalism. On this website and through the BSR Reports, BSR is providing its journalistic opinions about issues of concern to the general public. The views expressed in any BSR Report are BSR&rsquo;s own opinions, which BSR genuinely holds at the time of publication based on the analysis described in the report. You understand and agree that the opinions, information, and reports set forth on this website are attributable only to BSR, which bears sole responsibility for the information on this website and content of the BSR Reports; provided, however, that persons affiliated with Bleecker Street, and certain third parties, have provided BSR with publicly available information that BSR has included in the BSR Reports and on this website, following BSR&rsquo;s independent due diligence. Bleecker Street&rsquo;s economic relationships, and its sharing of research with affiliates and third parties, are described below under &ldquo;Coordination With, and Compensation From, Affiliates and Third Parties.&rdquo;</p>

      <h3>Coordination With, and Compensation From, Affiliates and Third Parties</h3>
      <p>You should not assume that BSR Reports are prepared in isolation, that they reflect only Bleecker Street&rsquo;s own work, or that Bleecker Street&rsquo;s economic interests are limited to its own positions in a Covered Issuer. In connection with its research and publication activities, Bleecker Street may, and does: (i) share all or a portion of its research, analyses, or conclusions regarding a Covered Issuer with affiliates and with third parties, including other investors and investment funds, in advance of the public dissemination of a BSR Report; (ii) coordinate with such affiliates and third parties regarding the substance or timing of a BSR Report; and (iii) receive compensation from, or pay compensation to, such affiliates or third parties in connection with its research or the positions taken in a Covered Issuer&rsquo;s securities. Such affiliates and third parties may hold, and may transact in, the securities of a Covered Issuer&mdash;including in advance of, concurrently with, or following the publication of a BSR Report&mdash;and may profit from price movements associated with a BSR Report. The research, opinions, and positions of Bleecker Street and of such affiliates and third parties may therefore not be independent of one another, and you should assume that persons other than Bleecker Street may have advance knowledge of the subject matter and timing of a BSR Report.</p>

      <h3>Website and Report Use Is at Your Own Risk</h3>
      <p>Any and all use of BSR&rsquo;s research and BSR Reports is entirely at your own risk. Neither BSR nor BSC is liable for any losses or damages you may incur as a result of your use of this website, including but not limited to any direct or indirect trading losses you may incur as a result of any information on this website, any BSR research, or any BSR Report. You agree to do your own research and due diligence with respect to any information on this website, and to consult your own financial, legal, and tax advisors before making any investment decision with respect to transacting in any securities of an issuer discussed on this website (a &ldquo;Covered Issuer&rdquo;).</p>

      <h3>BSC&rsquo;s Trading Practices and Positioning with Respect to Covered Issuers</h3>
      <p>As of the time and date of each report, Bleecker Street is short the securities of, or derivatives linked to, the securities of the Covered Issuer, unless otherwise stated in the report. Bleecker Street therefore will realize significant gains in the event that the prices of a Covered Issuer&rsquo;s securities decline. Upon the publication of each report, we intend to begin covering a substantial majority of our short positions. Our covering of our short positions upon the publication of a report is not a reflection of a lack of conviction in any opinions or the facts presented on this website or in any BSR Report. Rather, the act of covering our short positions upon the publication of a BSR Report is intended solely to manage risk in a prudent manner, consistent with the obligations of a fiduciary of our investors&rsquo; money. We are likely to continue transacting in the securities of Covered Issuer for an indefinite period after a report on a Covered Issuer, and we may be net short, net long or neutral positions in the Covered Issuer&rsquo;s securities after the initial publication of a report, regardless of our initial position and views herein. You should not make any investment decision based on your interpretation of our positioning in any Covered Issuer&rsquo;s securities. By the time you read a BSR Report, we may be covering, or may already have covered, all or substantially all of our position, and we are unlikely to increase our position unless it is in our financial interest to do so.</p>

      <h3>Notice to UK Residents</h3>
      <p>If you are in the United Kingdom, you confirm that you are accessing research and materials as or on behalf of: (a) an investment professional falling within Article 19 of the Financial Services and Markets Act 2000 (Financial Promotion) Order 2005 (the &ldquo;FPO&rdquo;); or (b) high net worth entity falling within Article 49 of the FPO (each a &ldquo;Permitted Recipient&rdquo;). In relation to the United Kingdom, the research and materials on this website are being issued only to, and are directed only at, persons who are Permitted Recipients and, without prejudice to any other restrictions or warnings set out in these Terms of Use, persons who are not Permitted Recipients must not act or rely on the information contained in any of the research or materials on this website.</p>

      <h3>No Recommendation or Solicitation; No Warranties</h3>
      <p>All information and opinions on this website and in BSR Reports are for informational purposes only. You understand and agree that no information on this website or in any BSR Report is investment advice or a recommendation or solicitation to buy or sell securities. We do not provide investment advice to any person unless one of our affiliates has entered into an investment adviser&ndash;client relationship with that person in writing. In any given BSR Report, BSR is solely articulating its reasons at the time of publication for the positions it may have in the securities of a Covered Issuer. To the best of BSR&rsquo;s ability and belief, all information contained herein is accurate and reliable, and has been obtained from public sources we believe to be accurate and reliable, and who are not insiders or connected persons of the securities of a Covered Issuer or who may otherwise owe any fiduciary duty or duty of confidentiality to the Covered Issuer. BSR conducts its own independent due diligence and does not knowingly base any BSR Report on material non-public information obtained in breach of any duty of confidentiality. However, such information is presented &ldquo;as is,&rdquo; without warranty of any kind, whether express or implied. BSR makes no representation, express or implied, as to the accuracy, timeliness, or completeness of any such information or with regard to the results to be obtained from its use. Research may contain forward-looking statements, estimates, projections, and opinions with respect to among other things, certain accounting, legal, and regulatory issues the issuer faces and the potential impact of those issues on its future business, financial condition, and results of operations, as well as more generally, the issuer&rsquo;s anticipated operating performance, access to capital markets, market conditions, assets, and liabilities. Such statements, estimates, projections, and opinions may prove to be substantially inaccurate and are inherently subject to significant risks and uncertainties beyond BSR&rsquo;s control. All expressions of opinion are subject to change without notice, and BSR does not commit to update or supplement any BSR Report or any of the information contained therein.</p>

