      <p>You further agree that you will not communicate or distribute the contents of BSR Reports and any other information on this site to any other person unless that person has agreed in writing to be bound by these Terms. You understand and agree that if you access this website, download or receive the contents of BSR Reports or other materials on this website as an agent for any other person, you are binding your principal to these Terms.</p>

